Protein "Friend Finder"

Create a WEB Interface
For each protein inserted papers are researched using scholarly

This then can be done at different levels of depth in the sense that proteins that are connected to the orignal can also be searched
In clear terms this should look like:
-A graph with the inserted protein at the center
-Nodes going out of the central protein for proteins that bind to it
-You  can click on the collections and then you will see the papers this binding is mentioned in
- If you click on a node information for every protein like
    - Total articles mentioned in
    - If you click on a node you get the option to load the new proteins connnections
    - What protein it is: (This is generated by an llm)
        - What it does
        - Structure
        - Where it is present


